  "rationale": "17 units of Butter 500ML at Outlet 03 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-23; doing nothing writes off ₹896 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹1128. This play uses a bundle with SKU-RUSK-200G at ₹110 for 318 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Tea connoisseurs, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 20 units, margin ₹204, discount cost ₹202, waste avoided ₹896 (CI 1 to 59 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Butter 500ML with Rusk 200G at a bundle price of 110.0 INR, which satisfies the 8% dairy margin floor and is preferred over markdowns by policy. It targets all consented customers across available segments to maximize reach and clear the expiring lot.",
